---
import '../styles/global.css';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <meta name="description" content="Healing the Heart — a Christ-centred journey toward healing, truth, restoration, and freedom." />
    <title>Healing the Heart</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Healing the Heart home">
        <span class="brand-mark">♥</span>
        <span>HEALING THE HEART</span>
      </a>
      <nav>
        <a href="#journey">Your Journey</a>
        <a href="#classes">Classes</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-glow"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
          <p class="eyebrow">A safe place for healing</p>
          <h1>You don't have to carry it alone.</h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">
            Healing the Heart is a Christ-centred journey where you can honestly face the wounds of your past, discover truth, and allow Jesus to bring healing and restoration.
          </p>
          <div class="actions">
            <a class="button primary" href="#journey">Explore the journey</a>
            <a class="button secondary" href="#classes">View classes</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="welcome section">
        <div class="narrow">
          <p class="eyebrow">Welcome</p>
          <h2>You are safe here.</h2>
          <p>
            You don't need to pretend you are okay. What happened to you matters, and you don't have to be ashamed of the places in your heart that still hurt.
          </p>
          <p>
            Healing is not about rushing, fixing, or forgetting. It is a journey of bringing what has been hidden into the light, replacing lies with truth, and discovering that Jesus is not frightened by your pain.
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="journey" class="journey section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">The healing journey</p>
          <h2>From wounded places toward wholeness.</h2>
          <p>Through teaching, reflection, prayer, honest conversation, and safe community, we make space for Jesus to restore what has been wounded.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
          <article><span>01</span><h3>A Safe Place</h3><p>Confidentiality, compassion, trust, honesty, and freedom from judgment.</p></article>
          <article><span>02</span><h3>Understanding the Heart</h3><p>Discover how pain and unmet needs can shape the ways we protect ourselves.</p></article>
          <article><span>03</span><h3>Facing What Was Lost</h3><p>Learn to acknowledge pain, grieve losses, and bring buried places into the light.</p></article>
          <article><span>04</span><h3>Truth & Restoration</h3><p>Replace the lies with God's truth and begin rebuilding trust, identity, and freedom.</p></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="classes" class="classes section">
        <div class="section-heading">
          <p class="eyebrow">Take the next step</p>
          <h2>Healing happens one honest step at a time.</h2>
          <p>Upcoming classes and healing opportunities will be shared here.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="placeholder-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Coming soon</p>
          <h3>Classes & upcoming dates</h3>
          <p>Current schedules, registration information, and details will be added as they are confirmed.</p>
          <a class="button primary" href="#">Registration</a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="about" class="about section">
        <div class="about-panel">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">The heart behind Healing the Heart</p>
            <h2>Healed people help bring healing to others.</h2>
          </div>
          <p>Our desire is to create a place where people can be honest about their story, encounter biblical truth, receive compassionate support, and experience the hope of restoration through Jesus.</p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <span>Healing the Heart</span>
      <span>A Christ-centred journey toward healing and restoration.</span>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
